bwa 0.7.19-r1273 (master)  chr1 300 kb + chr2 200 kb random; mate 1 = 90 bp chr1 + 60 bp chr2
default:
ok     SA entries equal the records they name: 1200/1200
ok     split-segment (0x800, or 0x100 under -M) MAPQ <= primary MAPQ: 600/600
ok     RNEXT/PNEXT/MQ equal the mate's primary record: 1800/1800
FAIL   MC:Z equals the mate's primary CIGAR: 1501/1800 records
     supplementary c1 CIGAR 90H60M  MC:Z:12H138M  but the mate's CIGAR is 12S138M
     supplementary c3 CIGAR 90H60M  MC:Z:12H138M  but the mate's CIGAR is 12S138M
     supplementary c5 CIGAR 90H60M  MC:Z:12H138M  but the mate's CIGAR is 12S138M
     supplementary c7 CIGAR 90H60M  MC:Z:12H138M  but the mate's CIGAR is 12S138M
     (299 supplementary records carry the mate's CIGAR with S rewritten as H)
   pairs with flag 0x2 on every record: 600/600
