ok     SA entries equal the records they name: 1200/1200
ok     split-segment (0x800, or 0x100 under -M) MAPQ <= primary MAPQ: 600/600
ok     RNEXT/PNEXT/MQ equal the mate's primary record: 1800/1800
ok     MC:Z equals the mate's primary CIGAR: 1800/1800 records
